license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  Cosmogon is a native, open-source living-universe sandbox that connects
  physical, biological and engineering processes across astronomical scales
  in one deterministic, replayable simulation. It provides a 3D universe
  viewer, editable planetary systems, finite habitat and spacecraft models,
  and research workflows with typed inputs, provenance, protected recordings
  and reproducible numeric exports.
keywords:
  - simulation
  - scientific-visualization
  - planetary-science
  - reproducibility
  - rust
